        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: American Heritage, Bon Appétit, Life, Horizon\n- People: Joseph J. Thorndike\n- Companies: Condé Nast\n- Topics: U.S. history, food and entertaining, mainstream readership\n\nFacts:\n- In the late 1940s, Joseph J. Thorndike was Managing Editor of Life for three years.\n- Joseph J. Thorndike was a co-founder of American Heritage and Horizon magazines.\n- American Heritage is a magazine dedicated to covering the history of the United States for a mainstream readership.\n- Bon Appétit is an American food and entertaining magazine published monthly by Condé Nast.",
